{"id":"6f984600c044f352","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-incompressible.md","title":"Plain Incompressible Strings","display":"df-incompressible — Plain Incompressible Strings","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-incompressible","aliases":["43-df-incompressible"],"display":"df-incompressible — Plain Incompressible Strings","depends_on":["[[43-df-kolm]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"§6.1, C-randomness and counting after Theorem 6.1.3","source_printed_pages":"88","source_pdf_pages":"108","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-incompressible"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-incompressible</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-incompressible — Plain Incompressible Strings"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" href=\"?note=a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" title=\"43-df-kolm\">43-df-kolm</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§6.1, C-randomness and counting after Theorem 6.1.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"88"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"108"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(c\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" href=\"?note=a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" title=\"43-df-kolm\">43-df-kolm</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Incompressible}\">\\(\\mathrm{Incompressible}\\)</span> 由本节 Assertion 的形式定义引入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Incompressible}(\\sigma,c)\\leftrightarrow C(\\sigma)\\ge|\\sigma|-c.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Incompressible}(\\sigma,c)\\leftrightarrow C(\\sigma)\\ge|\\sigma|-c.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，§6.1, C-randomness and counting after Theorem 6.1.3；印刷页 88，PDF 页 108。本次逐项核对陈述；来源证明的已读范围见本次审阅账本，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-kolm","status":"resolved","id":"a0589ee7a1cc12e8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-kolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kolm","status":"resolved","id":"a0589ee7a1cc12e8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*$，$c\\in\\mathbb N$；$C$ 见 [[43-df-kolm]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Incompressible}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Incompressible}(\\sigma,c)\\leftrightarrow C(\\sigma)\\ge|\\sigma|-c.","display":true}],"bytes":1164,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-101","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-incompressible]] — Plain Incompressible Strings"},{"id":"ccbf8f0ef5d3cfe6","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[43-df-prefixkolm]] 的 $K$；自然数参数按 [[43-df-pair-coding]] 的 $\\operatorname{bin}$ 编码。 $\\mathrm{Incompressible}$ 见 [[43-df-incompressible]]。"},{"id":"b732c7d55f62216b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n,k\\in\\mathbb N$，$k\\le n$；$C$ 与 $\\mathrm{Incompressible}$ 见 [[43-df-kolm]]、[[43-df-incompressible]]。"},{"id":"83ee10b8723e0c9d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{StrongKRandom}$、$\\mathrm{Incompressible}$ 见 [[43-df-strong-krandom]]、[[43-df-incompressible]]。"}],"outgoing":["a0589ee7a1cc12e8"]}